  "details": "Allow searching usernames that use diactrics and accents on the vrchat website.\n\nIf a user has \"è\", \"é\", \"ü\", \"ł\" or similar letters you cannot search his username on the site using \"e\", \"e\", \"u\", \"l\".\n\n \n\nExample: \n\nUsername is \"Crème Brulée\".\n\nSearching for \"Creme\" doesnt show the user.\n\nYou could implement a check similar to this:\n\n\"Crème Brulée\".normalize(\"NFD\").replace(/[\\u0300-\\u036f]/g, \"\").replace(/\\u0142/g, \"l\") === $userInput\n\n(second replace required to target \"ł\")",
